libconfig-model-openssh-perl (1.230-1) unstable; urgency=low

  From the upstream changes:
    * '/etc/ssh/ssh_config' is now handled by system-ssh. I.e.
       use 'cme edit system-ssh' to change this file
    * root user can edit its ~/.ssh/config file like any other user
      with 'cme edit ssh'.

 -- gregor herrmann <gregoa@debian.org>  Fri, 09 Aug 2013 21:13:34 +0200
